---
import DrawnArt from './DrawnArt.astro';
import { windSlug } from '../data/stories';
---
<section class="three-ways"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">THE SAME STORY, THREE WAYS</p><h2>Find your way in.</h2></div><p>Hold a book. Read at your own pace.<br />Or let the drawings move with the voice.</p></div><div class="ways-grid"><article><DrawnArt name="icon-book" class="way-art" /><span class="way-number">01 / IN YOUR HANDS</span><h3>The printed book</h3><p>An illustrated edition to keep, revisit, or give to someone.</p><a class="text-link" href={`/stories/${windSlug}/#edition`}>Explore the first edition ↗</a></article><article><DrawnArt name="n01" class="way-art" /><span class="way-number">02 / AT YOUR PACE</span><h3>Online reading</h3><p>The complete story and its drawings, free to read in English or Spanish.</p><a class="text-link" href="/read/wind/#story">Start reading →</a></article><article><DrawnArt name="n06" crop="-720 1580 535 505" class="way-art" /><span class="way-number">03 / WITH THE VOICE</span><h3>Immersive reading</h3><p>Narration, sound, and drawings that follow the story together.</p><a class="text-link" href="/immerse/wind/">Enter the story →</a></article></div></div></section>
